  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Primary Healthcare Services Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s main objective is to contribute to the reinforcement  of  the  health  sector  capacity  and  ensure  equity  in  accessing  healthcare  services  among  various  population  groups  in  Lebanon.  Specifically, the  project  aims  at  improving   the  access  to   and   quality  of  primary  health   care  services  through  the  construction  and  rehabilitation of 8  primary health  care centres.</narrative>
  </description>
